msgid "Install Mattermost Boards"
msgstr "OKR.BEST Boards 설치"

#: ../../source/_static/badges/entry-ent.rst:9
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Enterprise, and Enterprise "
"Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__ (not available on "
"Professional)"
msgstr "|plans-img-yellow| `Entry, Enterprise, Enterprise Advanced 플랜 <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__\ 에서 사용할 수 있습니다(Professional에서는 사용할 수 없음)"

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:7
msgid ""
"Mattermost Boards is not enabled by default for new Mattermost Enterprise"
" instances. If the Mattermost Boards plugin isn't enabled for your "
"Mattermost workspace, self-hosted Enterprise customers can install this "
"plugin by manually uploading the binary release file into the System "
"Console and enabling it."
msgstr "OKR.BEST Boards는 새 Mattermost Enterprise 인스턴스에서 기본적으로 활성화되어 있지 않습니다. OKR.BEST Boards 플러그인이 OKR.BEST 워크스페이스에 활성화되어 있지 않은 경우, 셀프 호스팅 Enterprise 고객은 바이너리 릴리스 파일을 관리자 도구에 수동으로 업로드하고 활성화하여 이 플러그인을 설치할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:9
msgid ""
"Mattermost Cloud Enterprise customers can request the Boards plugins be "
"enabled by contacting their Mattermost Account Manager or by `creating a "
"support ticket <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-"
"us/requests/new?ticket_form_id=11184911962004>`_ request."
msgstr "Mattermost Cloud Enterprise 고객은 Mattermost Account Manager에게 문의하거나 `지원 티켓 생성 <https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/requests/new?ticket_form_id=11184911962004>`_ 요청을 통해 Boards 플러그인 활성화를 요청할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:13
msgid ""
"The Mattermost Boards plugin is currently in maintenance mode. While "
"adoption of this plugin is still supported for Enterprise customers, we "
"recommend system admins proceed at their own risk. Mattermost is no "
"longer actively developing new features or future improvements for the "
"Boards plugin, beyond addressing bug fixes reported by Enterprise "
"customers and any necessary security patches."
msgstr "OKR.BEST Boards 플러그인은 현재 유지 관리 모드입니다. 이 플러그인의 도입은 여전히 Enterprise 고객에게 지원되지만, 시스템 관리자가 자신의 책임 하에 진행할 것을 권장합니다. OKR.BEST는 Enterprise 고객이 보고한 버그 수정 및 필요한 보안 패치 외에는 더 이상 Boards 플러그인의 새로운 기능이나 향후 개선 사항을 적극적으로 개발하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:15
msgid ""
"In the future, Mattermost plans to deliver a core Boards feature as part "
"of the platform. Migration from the Boards plugin to this upcoming "
"feature will be required, which could potentially involve downtime or "
"data migration complexities. Keep this in mind when deploying the Boards "
"plugin in production environments."
msgstr "향후 OKR.BEST는 핵심 Boards 기능을 플랫폼의 일부로 제공할 계획입니다. Boards 플러그인에서 이 향후 기능으로의 마이그레이션이 필요하며, 여기에는 다운타임이나 데이터 마이그레이션의 복잡성이 수반될 수 있습니다. 프로덕션 환경에 Boards 플러그인을 배포할 때 이 점을 염두에 두세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:18
msgid "Install the plugin"
msgstr "플러그인 설치"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:20
msgid ""
"The following steps apply to customers in fully connected environments as"
" well as Denied, Disrupted, Intermittent, and Limited (DDIL) "
"environments. A Mattermost system admin must perform the following steps "
"in Mattermost."
msgstr "다음 단계는 완전히 연결된 환경뿐만 아니라 DDIL(Denied, Disrupted, Intermittent, and Limited) 환경의 고객에게도 적용됩니다. OKR.BEST 시스템 관리자가 OKR.BEST에서 다음 단계를 수행해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:22
msgid ""
"Download the latest Mattermost Boards plugin binary file from the "
"`Mattermost Boards Releases <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"plugin-boards/releases>`_ page."
msgstr "`Mattermost Boards Releases <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-boards/releases>`_ 페이지에서 최신 OKR.BEST Boards 플러그인 바이너리 파일을 다운로드합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:23
msgid "Log in to your Mattermost System Console as a system admin."
msgstr "시스템 관리자로 OKR.BEST 관리자 도구에 로그인합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:24
msgid "Go to **Plugins > Plugin Management**."
msgstr "**플러그인 > 플러그인 관리**로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:25
msgid ""
"Select **Upload Plugin** to upload the Boards plugin binary file you "
"downloaded from the Mattermost Releases page."
msgstr "**Upload Plugin**을 선택하여 Mattermost Releases 페이지에서 다운로드한 Boards 플러그인 바이너리 파일을 업로드합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:28
msgid "Mattermost configuration"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 구성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:30
msgid "Go to **Plugins > Mattermost Boards**."
msgstr "**플러그인 > OKR.BEST Boards**로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:31
msgid "Select **Enable Plugin** to enable the plugin."
msgstr "**Enable Plugin**을 선택하여 플러그인을 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:32
msgid ""
"You can optionally enable **Enable Publicly-Shared Boards** so that board"
" editors can share boards with people outside of your Mattermost "
"instance, who can view the board without needing a Mattermost account."
msgstr "선택적으로 **Enable Publicly-Shared Boards**를 활성화하면, 보드 편집자가 OKR.BEST 인스턴스 외부의 사람들과 보드를 공유할 수 있으며, 이들은 OKR.BEST 계정 없이도 보드를 볼 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:33
msgid "Select **Save** to save your changes."
msgstr "**Save**를 선택하여 변경 사항을 저장합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:36
msgid "Access"
msgstr "접근"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:38
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`navigate boards </end-user-guide/project-management"
"/navigate-boards>` documentation to learn how to create and access "
"boards."
msgstr "보드를 만들고 접근하는 방법은 :doc:`보드 탐색 </end-user-guide/project-management/navigate-boards>` 문서를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:41
msgid "Work with boards"
msgstr "보드 작업"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/install-boards.rst:43
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`project and task management </end-user-guide/project-task-"
"management>` end user documentation to learn how to align, define, "
"organize, track, and manage work across teams."
msgstr "팀 전반의 작업을 정렬, 정의, 구성, 추적, 관리하는 방법은 :doc:`프로젝트 및 작업 관리 </end-user-guide/project-task-management>` 최종 사용자 문서를 참조하세요."

